9. Known Issues
===============

9.1 SPI-NOR Flash
-----------------
The SPI-NOR Flash on ZCU102 Board does not support read/write operations
starting at an odd offset with sizes larger than 4MB. The following error
can be observed:

	root@amd-zynqmp:~# mtd_debug read /dev/mtd3 1 0x400000 /tmp/source.filename
	read(): Cannot allocate memory

9.2 USB OTG
-----------
When configuring the ZCU102 board as a host to test the OTG functionality,
it fails to enumerate a USB device after multiple connect/disconnect
iterations. Please refer to the following link for a detailed description.
	https://adaptivesupport.amd.com/s/article/000039307?language=en_US
